
>> shop := (Foclóir nua
	cuir: ['magazine'] ag: ['books'],
	cuir: ['computer'] ag: ['electronics'],
	cuir: ['lipstick'] ag: ['cosmetics']
).
Aschur scríobh: (shop tá-aige: ['computer']), líne-nua. 
Aschur scríobh: (shop tá-aige: ['sausage']), líne-nua. 
Aschur scríobh: (shop tá-aige: ['computers']), líne-nua. 
Aschur scríobh: (shop tá-aige: ['compute']), líne-nua. 
Aschur scríobh: (shop tá-aige: ['2computer']), líne-nua. 
